    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0169" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg77"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d112-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-11-10">10 November 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and secret from the President for the Former Naval Person. Number
                    416.</p>
                <p>Your 497.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d112-f2"/> As we cannot arrive <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Oboe</hi> before forenoon November 20th it seems to
                    me impracticable to have a meeting at Malta enroute to <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Sextant</hi>. It is best to go straight through with
                    one stop at Tunis for the night.</p>
                <p>Perhaps we can visit Malta on the return journey.</p>
                <p>I am glad you are bringing Winant.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d112-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d112-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d112-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d112-f2" n="2" xml:id="d112-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg76">p. 76</ref>.</p>
